---
const faqs = [
  {
    question:
      "Can one project include several LKProfessionals services?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Many projects naturally cross service boundaries. A website may involve branding, SEO and integrations, while a software project may include mobile applications, infrastructure, automation and analytics.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "How do we know which service we actually need?",
    answer:
      "You do not need to diagnose the technical solution before contacting us. The useful starting point is the business problem, current process, users and intended outcome.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Does LKProfessionals work with existing systems?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Projects can involve improving, integrating, maintaining or replacing existing technology as well as developing new systems.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can projects be delivered in phases?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Larger projects often benefit from phased delivery so core requirements can be validated before additional functionality is introduced.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Do you provide ongoing support after delivery?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Maintenance and support arrangements can cover production systems that require continued technical attention after launch.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can LKProfessionals work with international businesses?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Projects can be delivered remotely for businesses in different markets depending on scope, communication requirements and project needs.",
  },
];
---

<section class="services-faq">
  <div class="site-container services-faq__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Services FAQ</p>

      <h2>
        Start with the problem. We can work out the technology.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-faq__list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-faq {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .services-faq__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(16rem, 0.68fr)
      minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .services-faq__layout
    > div:first-child > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #0b2f8f;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .services-faq h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #0d203c;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .services-faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ec;
  }

  .services-faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ec;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .services-faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #293b53;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .services-faq details p {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: #788497;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .services-faq__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
